{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a near-future Eastern cyber world, powerful tech conglomerates hold absolute power, continuously controlling and exploiting ordinary citizens. Your mission is to rise up against these corporations and bring them constant trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825770/extras/1a320457852f5f33547ef46c07f43388.poster.avif?t=1764235322\" width=696 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825770/extras/1a320457852f5f33547ef46c07f43388.webm?t=1764235322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825770/extras/1a320457852f5f33547ef46c07f43388.mp4?t=1764235322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from multiple starting characters, each with access to a wide range of freely customizable combat skills. Acquire new abilities and passive gear throughout the battle, and use a mix of martial arts techniques and high-tech equipment to defeat all your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825770/extras/ecc71964c3a9f317795ec7fbe977b70b.poster.avif?t=1764235322\" width=664 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825770/extras/ecc71964c3a9f317795ec7fbe977b70b.webm?t=1764235322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825770/extras/ecc71964c3a9f317795ec7fbe977b70b.mp4?t=1764235322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3825770?t=1764235322","backgroun